      "text": "1. Someone posts the\nproblems in a channel:\n\norders over 19 items\nare undercharged;\na 150% promo code made\na total negative",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
